#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:30
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Predstavljanje"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:32
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In many small local area networks, the <acronym>SMB</acronym> protocol is "
"used to offer network services. Names like <quote>&Windows; Network</quote> "
"or <quote>&Windows; for Workgroups Network</quote> or <quote>LanManager</"
"quote> are often used as well. Using <acronym>SMB</acronym> you can access "
"so-called <quote>shares</quote> (&ie; folders made available by the server) "
"as well as printers."
msgstr ""
"U mnogim malim lokalnim mrežama, <acronym>SMB</acronym>  protokol je "
"korišten da ponudi usluge interneta. Imena kao <quote>&Windows; Network</"
"quote> ili <quote>&Windows; for Workgroups Network</quote> ili "
"<quote>LanManager</quote> su također često korištena. Koristeći "
"<acronym>SMB</acronym> možete koristiti također takozvano <quote>Dijeljenje</"
"quote> (&ie; direktoriji koji su dostupni od strane servera) kao i printeri."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:40
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kde; comes with built-in support for the <acronym>SMB</acronym> protocol. "
"As &kde; is network-transparent that means you can access <acronym>SMB</"
"acronym> shares from everywhere you can access your local files, for example "
"in the &konqueror; file manager and in the file dialog. To make use of this "
"you should provide &kde; with some information on your <acronym>SMB</"
"acronym> network. But don't worry, this is normally pretty simple as, for "
"example, all the Windows clients in your network need and have the same "
"information."
msgstr ""
"&kde; dolazi sa već ugrađenom podrškom za  <acronym>SMB</acronym> protokol. "
"Kako je  &kde; transparentna mreža, to znači da možete pristupiti  "
"<acronym>SMB</acronym> dijeljenjima sa svih mjesta odakle možete pristupiti "
"vašim lokalnim datotetkama, na primjer u &konqueror; upravljaču datotekama u "
"okviru datoteka. Da biste imali koristi od ovoga trebate obezbijediti &kde; "
"sa nekim informacijama na vašoj  <acronym>SMB</acronym> mreži. Ako ne "
"brinite, ovo je obično prilično jednostavno, kao na primjer, svi Windows "
"klijenti u mreži trebaju da imaju iste informacije."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:58
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For the <acronym>SMB</acronym> protocol to work, it is required to have "
"<application>Samba</application> correctly installed."
msgstr ""
"Da bi <acronym>SMB</acronym> protokol radio, treba da imate ispravno "
"instaliranu aplikaciju  <application>Samba</application>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:68
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Use</title>"
msgstr "<title>Koristi</title>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:70
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Although there are a lot of insecure <acronym>SMB</acronym> networks out "
"there which allow access to anyone, in principle you have to authenticate "
"yourself to access the services of an <acronym>SMB</acronym> server. By "
"default, &kde; will use the data entered in the <guilabel>Default user name</"
"guilabel> and <guilabel>Default password</guilabel> fields to authenticate "
"itself on <acronym>SMB</acronym> hosts. If you leave the field "
"<guilabel>Default user name</guilabel> empty, &kde; will try to access "
"<acronym>SMB</acronym> hosts without a username. If you leave the default "
"password empty, it will try without a password. If &kde; is unsuccessful "
"accessing the host using these settings, you will be asked for a username "
"and a password."
msgstr ""
"Iako postoji dosta nesigurnih  <acronym>SMB</acronym>  mreža koje "
"dozvoljavaju pristup svima, u principu vi morate da potvrdite svoj identitet "
"da biste pristupili uslugama <acronym>SMB</acronym> servera. Zadano je &kde; "
"koristi podatke unesene u poljima <guilabel>Zadano korisničko ime </"
"guilabel> i <guilabel>Zadana šifra</guilabel> da potvrdi sebe na  "
"<acronym>SMB</acronym> hostu. Ako ostavite polje <guilabel>Zadano korisničko "
"ime</guilabel> prazno, &kde; će pokušati pristupiti <acronym>SMB</acronym> "
"hostu bez korisničkog imena. Ako ostavite prostor za zadanu šifru prazan, "
"pokušat će pristupiti bez šifre. Ako &kde;  ne uspije pristupiti hostu "
"koristeći ovakve postavke, od Vas će se tražiti da unesete korisničko ime i "
"šifru."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:83
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"While it makes things more comfortable if &kde; stores your <acronym>SMB</"
"acronym> password, this may be a security problem. If you are using "
"<acronym>SMB</acronym> in a security conscious environment, you should not "
"store your password here but rather enter it anew every time you need to "
"access an <acronym>SMB</acronym> host."
msgstr ""
"Iako se snimanje Vaše  <acronym>SMB</acronym>  šifre od strane &kde; čini "
"ugodnijim za korištenje, ovo pravi sigurnosni problem. Ako koristite  "
"<acronym>SMB</acronym>  u uslovima koji zahtijevaju sigurnost, ne biste "
"trebali čuvati šifru ovdje, nego je radije unositi svaki put kada trebate "
"pristupati  <acronym>SMB</acronym>  hostu."
